{{!-- The road so far — /about's variant of partials/journey.hbs
(the homepage keeps the horizontal scroll-snap strip).

Dense ROWS, not stacked cards: year, place, one line. Seven padded
cards on a rail ran the height of two screens for what is a CV, and
a CV is read by scanning the left column. The "your turn" card went
with them — the page already ends on a call to action, and the
timeline is stronger finishing on the real present.

⚠ THE YEARS BELOW ARE PLACEHOLDERS — see journey.hbs. Correct both
files together if you fix the real dates. --}}
<section class="section outer">
    <div class="inner">
        <div class="section-head" data-animate>
            <div>
                <span class="kicker">{{> "icons/map-icon"}} {{t "The journey"}}</span>
                <h2>{{t "From job seeker to Salesforce engineer"}}</h2>
            </div>
            <a class="section-more" href="{{@site.url}}/courses/">{{t "Start your own chapter"}} {{> "icons/arrow-right"}}</a>
        </div>

        <ol class="cv-list" data-animate-stagger>
            <li>
                <time>2018</time>
                <strong>{{t "Job seeker"}}</strong>
                <span>{{t "Degree in hand, inbox full of applications. The only real asset: the will to learn anything."}}</span>
            </li>
            <li>
                <time>2019</time>
                <strong>Accenture</strong>
                <span>{{t "First project, first production incident, first win."}}</span>
            </li>
            <li>
                <time>2020</time>
                <strong>{{t "Trailblazer"}}</strong>
                <span>{{t "Met Salesforce on a project and never left — badges by night, real orgs by day."}}</span>
            </li>
            <li>
                <time>2022</time>
                <strong>Cognizant</strong>
                <span>{{t "Bigger enterprises, bigger orgs — how real projects actually run."}}</span>
            </li>
            <li>
                <time>2024</time>
                <strong>Twilio</strong>
                <span>{{t "GTM engineering — where Salesforce meets revenue, data and messaging at speed."}}</span>
            </li>
            <li class="is-now">
                <time>{{t "Now"}}</time>
                <strong>Education First</strong>
                <span>{{t "Salesforce Engineer at a global education company — and sharing every lesson here."}}</span>
            </li>
        </ol>
    </div>
</section>
